title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1710260005":{"text":"と、突然、いなくなってしまったんです！まるで、まるで見えない何かに、連れ去られたように……！","source_cn":"然后、然后他突然就不见了！就像……就像被什么看不见的东西一把拽走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B16024FAF74364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710260006:0":{"text":"いえ、何も……本当に一瞬の出来事で、何が何だか……","source_cn":"没有！什么都没有！前一秒还在，下一秒人就没了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE80BDFAAC7FF9B9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710260007:0":{"text":"落ち着いてください。あなたの主人のお名前は？","source_cn":"冷静！告诉我你的主人是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7239447193550842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710260008:0":{"text":"ウサルス子爵様です。<style=\"highlight\">内務副大臣</style>の……","source_cn":"我的主人是乌瑟斯子爵，<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECC5C32385EAE575","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710260009:0":{"text":"お願いです！ご主人様を探してください！","source_cn":"大人，求求你们一定要找到我的主人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1349E332C789EDFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710260010:0":{"text"